# Auto-memory Stop-hook scratch. ONLY the root memory/ is curated and tracked.
# When the hook's cwd lands inside an app (the Bun cwd-reset quirk seen in sessions),
# it mis-scaffolds per-app memory dirs; ignore those so they never leak into a branch
# or a merge to main (as happened in the M2 RunSink merge, b543e5d).
**/.stop-hook-state.json
apps/*/memory/
packages/*/memory/
